From: JanTrueno <159560609+JanTrueno@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:38:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] arm64: dts: rockchip: miniloong: enable rockchip-suspend

Enable rockchip_suspend so the board can wake from suspend. The defaults in
rk3568.dtsi fit this board.

AI assistance was used in preparing this patch.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-miniloong.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-miniloong.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-miniloong.dts
index fa532ed0e..e54b29b2b 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-miniloong.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-miniloong.dts
@@ -1391,6 +1391,10 @@ &pwm4 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&rockchip_suspend {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &rk_rga {
 	status = "okay";
 };
